+[COMPILE OPTIONS]
+  A compile-time option is ONE entry in metadata.json:compile_options
+  (enabled / requirement / dependency_key / defines / why). conanfile.py, CMakeLists.txt and the
+  schema consume that table; nobody edits a build file to add an option. Precedence:
+  a Conan `-o <option>=...` run overrides the file's `enabled`, because it is a per-run choice.
